@AwsApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5142

### Untagged resources (missing project tag) by region
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/audits/untagged-resources?region=us-east-1
Accept: application/json

###

### Resources by project tag value
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/audits/resources-by-project?region=us-east-1&projectTagValue=my-app
Accept: application/json

###

### List public S3 buckets by region
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/s3/public-buckets?region=us-east-1
Accept: application/json

###

### List EC2 instances with open inbound ports by region
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ec2/open-ports?region=us-east-1
Accept: application/json

###

### List EC2 security groups not attached to any ENI by region
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ec2/unused-security-groups?region=us-east-1
Accept: application/json

###

### List unattached EBS volumes by region
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ec2/unattached-volumes?region=us-east-1
Accept: application/json

###

### List RDS instances with open inbound ports by region
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/rds/open-ports?region=us-east-1
Accept: application/json

###

### List IAM access keys
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/iam/access-keys
Accept: application/json

###

### Costs grouped by project tag (inclusive date range)
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cost/by-project?startDate=2026-05-01&endDate=2026-05-31
Accept: application/json

###

### Inspector vulnerabilities by region (optional filters: resourceType, severity, status)
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/inspector/vulnerabilities?region=us-east-1&resourceType=ec2&severity=HIGH&status=ACTIVE
Accept: application/json

###
